{"id":"bcf5fa8a7fd2252e","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-modular-identity.md","title":"Modular Identity","display":"Modular Identity","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-modular-identity","aliases":["93-lem-modular-identity"],"display":"Modular Identity","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-lattice]]","[[93-df-modular-lattice]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-modular-identity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-modular-identity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Modular Identity"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ad379574ef6f3a71\" href=\"?note=ad379574ef6f3a71\" title=\"93-df-modular-lattice\">93-df-modular-lattice</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-modular-identity---Modular-Identity\">lem-modular-identity - Modular Identity</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\">\\(\\mathbf L\\)</span> is a lattice candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lat}\\)</span> is the lattice class of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}\\)</span> is the predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ad379574ef6f3a71\" href=\"?note=ad379574ef6f3a71\" title=\"93-df-modular-lattice\">93-df-modular-lattice</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}modular\\text{-}identity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\n\\Bigl(x\\leq_{\\mathbf L}z\\to\nx\\vee^{\\mathbf L}(y\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}z)=\n(x\\vee^{\\mathbf L}y)\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}z\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}modular\\text{-}identity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\n\\Bigl(x\\leq_{\\mathbf L}z\\to\nx\\vee^{\\mathbf L}(y\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}z)=\n(x\\vee^{\\mathbf L}y)\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}z\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The displayed conditional identity is the lattice-theoretic modular law.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-modular-identity---Modular-Identity","text":"lem-modular-identity - Modular Identity","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-modular-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"ad379574ef6f3a71","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-modular-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lat}$ is the lattice class of [[93-df-lattice]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-modular-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"ad379574ef6f3a71","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-modular-lattice]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}modular\\text{-}identity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\n\\Bigl(x\\leq_{\\mathbf L}z\\to\nx\\vee^{\\mathbf L}(y\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}z)=\n(x\\vee^{\\mathbf L}y)\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}z\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":923,"backlinks":[{"id":"a88cbe3bc2083801","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b02709d433be516c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0eb6f89ad348c35f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["3b5f38bd115ed203","ad379574ef6f3a71"]}